//! Networking package: address parsing, socket bridge and TCP/UDP helpers.
//!
//! ```loi
//! import "lib/net.loi"            // broad package import
//! import "lib/net/address.loi"    // fine-grained import
//!
//! parsed <- net::net_parse_ipv4("127.0.0.1")
//! ```
//!
//! The byte-level and endpoint code is pure Loi. `net_shim.c` is the only C
//! boundary and is linked with `--c-source lib/net_shim.c`. `net` depends on
//! `core` and may use `os` conventions, but never imports `std` as a root.

open import "net/address.loi"
open import "net/socket.loi"
open import "net/tcp.loi"
open import "net/udp.loi"
